        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Akebiliibwa ebiemisango echimaliilwe ebifwanani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne bulaano, khumakhuwa kebindu biemisango echimaliilwe ebifwanani; Khumanyile shinga olwa khuli nobumanyi fwesi. Obumanyi buchinjimisinjia, ne obuheeli buumbakhanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omundu yesi naba nakaala mbu wamanya likhuwa, aba nashili okhumanya likhuwa liosi shinga olwa limukhoyeele okhumanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne omundu naba namuheela Nyasaye, omwene amumanyishilanga Nyasaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.8.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho khumakhuwa akokhulia ebindu biemisango echimaliilwe ebifwanani, khumanyile mbu eshifwanani shishili eshindu mushibala ta, khandi mbu abulaho nyasaye undi ta, habula niMulala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shichila kata nibaba nibaliho abalangwa mbu abanyasaye, kata mwikulu kata mushibala; shinga olwa baliho abanyasaye abanji nende abaami abanji; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nebutswa khwifwe aliho Nyasaye mulala, mbu Seefwe, owa amakhuwa kosi karulakhwo, neefu nikhuchooma khuye; khandi aliho Omwami mulala, mbu Yesu Kristo, owa amakhuwa kosi keetsa khululwe, neefu nikhubaho khululwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.8.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa shibali bosi abali nobumanyi obwo ta; ne abandi, abanala akebifwanani okhuula bulaano, bashiliitsangakhwo nibapaara shinga olwa shili eshindu shiomusango okumaliilwe eshifwanani; mana emioyo chiabwe, olwa chili emiteshele chionoonekhanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne ebiliibwa shibilikhusitia khuNyasaye ta; nikhuba nikhuralia, shikhukosia eshindu ta, kata nikhuba nikhulia shikhumeetekha eshindu ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne mubeetsenje meeso, obulel huule bweenywe obwo buleshe okhwisichirasia abateshele mumioyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shichila omundu naba nakhulola iwe ouli nobumanyi, niwikhaale noliitsanga muhekalu yeshifwanani, naye nali omuteshele mumwoyo, shiyakhanyoola itswoni ario okhulia khubindu biemisango echimaliilwe ebifwanani? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba khulwa obumanyi bubwo, oyo ouli omuteshele mumwoyo atiba, omwana weefwe owa Kristo yafwila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho olwa mwonoonelanga abaana beefwe nimusaalisia emioyo chiabwe echili emiteshele chirio, habwenaho mumwonoonelanga Kristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko akachila, eshiokhulia nishiba nishimwisichirasia omwana weefwe, shindalaliakhwo inyama inziayo tawe, mbu endeshe okhumwisichirasia omwana weefwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.8.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
